<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- Gamo Full Bible final version</book>
  <para style="h">Qolasiyaase Asaas</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosi Qolasiyaase Asaas Xaafida Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">Qolasiyaase Asaas</para>
  <para style="toc3">Qola</para>
  <para style="mt2">Phawuloosi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Qolasiyaase Asaas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafida Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt1">Giddo Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Hayssi kiitazi xaafettiday qeeri Iisiyan diza Efesoone katamappe arshey mokkiza baggara diza Qolasiyaase kataman diza Woosa Keeththassa; hinno he Woosa Keeththayo essiday Phawuloosa gidontta aggikokka iza Oroome kawoteththa garsan diza Iisiyan waanna katama gidida Efesooneppe Mishiraachcho qaala yootizayta hee yeddida gishshas Qolasiyaaseska alaafeteththi dees; Qolasiyaase Woosa Keeththan, «Xoossa eranaassinne mulera atoteth demmanaas issi issi asi hu7en hu7en wolqqama ayanatassinne godatas goynnanaas koshshees» giza wordo astamaareti dizayssa Phawuloosi siyides; he astamaareti tamaarsiza hara yooti, «Asi wurikka qaxxara wogaas haarettanaas bessees; kaththa muussa woganne hara wogatakka naaganaas bessees» giidi tamaarseettes.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosi ha kiitaza xaafiday tumu gidida ammano timirte tamaardi he wordo astamaareta timirteza digganaassa; iza malthetappe waannatizay, «Yesus Kirstoosi kumeththa atoteth immees; hankkoyti ammaniza ammanoy gidikko Yesusappe haasseettes» gizayssa. Xoossi hayssa alameza Kirstoosan medhdhides; qasseka Xoossi ha alameza Kirstoosa baggara baakko zaari ehana; hayssi alamezi attanay Kirstoosa wozinappe ammanon xalla. Hessan eqqidi Phawuloosi hayssi wolqqama timirtey ammanizayta de7on waani daanaas koshshizaakko bessees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hayssa ha kiitaza Phawuloosappe ekkidi Qolasiyaase asaas gaththanaas kiitettida Tiqiqoosara issife dizay Anasmoosa gididayssa eroy maaddizaaza. Phawuloosi he Anasmoosa geetettiza aylleza gishshas Pilmoonas hara kiita xaafides. Qolasiyaase kiitaa giddon diza qofay Efesoone kiitaara addafe gayttees; nam7ayka issi woden xaafettida. Istta giddon diza gita dummateththi Efesoone kiitan Phawuloosi Kirstoosa Woosa keeththaa hu7e ooththidi shiishshees; qasse Qolasiyaase kiitaan Kirstoosa medheteth ubbaas hu7e ooththidi shiishshees. Hayssa izi ooththiday Xoossi medhdhida kiitanchchatas goynoy eeyateth gididayssa bessanaassa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ha Maxaafay Oykkida Kumeththa Qofa</para>
  <para style="io1">Geloso <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 1:1-8">1:1-8</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kirstoosa hanonne iza ooso <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 1:9-2:19">1:9—2:19</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kirstoosan diza ooraththa de7o <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 2:20-4:6">2:20—4:6</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kuushsha qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 4:7-18">4:7-18</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Xoossa shenen Yesus Kirstoosan kiitettida Phawuloosappenne nu ishaa Ximtoosappe, <verse eid="COL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />Qolasiyaasen diza Kirstoosan dummatidaytassinne ammanettida ishatas nu Aawaa Xoossaafe saroteththinne kiyateththi inttes gido.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Galata Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Nu intte gishshas woossiza ubba gallas nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa Aawaa Xoossaa galatoos. <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />Gaasoykka inttes Yesus Kirstoosan diza ammanoninne ammaniza asaa intte ubbaa siiqizayssa nu siyida gishshassa. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Hessi wurikka haniday salon inttes giigettida hidotappe dendidayssanna; hessa he hidota gishshas Mishiraachcho qaalaa intte kasetidi siyideta. <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />Hessika hee intteko gakkides; hessa Mishiraachcho qaalaa intte siyoosoppenne Xoossa kiyateththa tumateththa intte eroo gallassafe haa simmiin alame yuushon izi ooththishe dizayssa mala intte achchan ayfe ayfishenne diccishe dees. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Hessaka ha7i nu gishshas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nu gishshas: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nu gishshas gizayssa issi issi Geeshsha Maxaafatan intte gishshas geetettides.</char></note> gididi Kirstoosas ammanettida oosanchcha gididayssinne nunara issife ooththizanne siiqiza Ephafiray inttena tamaarsides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:12">Qola 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Pilm 23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />Qasseka izi inttenan diza Ayana siiqoteththaa nuus yootides.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Nu qasse hessa siyoosoppe haa simmiin intte Xoossa shene erateththaninne akeekan inttena kunththana mala intte gishshas woosa qanxxibeekko. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />Hessaththoka Godaas bessiza duus daana mala intte iza poli ufayssana mala lo7o ooso ubbaan ayfe immana malanne Xoos eron dicci dicci baana mala nu inttes woossoos. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Goday ba gita wolqqan ba minoteth ubbaa inttes immo; wursika intte dandayana malanne ufayssan giigettidayta gidana mala inttena izi maaddo. <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />Ammanizayti laattizaso poo7o kawoteth laattizayta nu gidana mala nuna gaththida nu Aawaa intte galatanaassa. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Izi nuna dhuman haareteththafe ashshidi gede ba dosiza naaza kawoteththan pinththides. <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />Nu izan wozzettidi nagarappe maarettidos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:7">Efe 1:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kirstoosi Ubbaafe Bolla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Kirstoosi ayfen beettontta Xoossas tumu leemiso; medheteththa ubbaafe gitanne bayra. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Medheteththi wuri izan medhettides. Saloninne sa7an dizayti, ayfen beettizaytinne beettonttayti gidiinkka, wolqqamata gidiinkka, haarizayti gidiinkka woykko godateththi dizayti haniday wurikka izan izas medhettida. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Izi ubbaafe kase dees; wurikka issi bolla oyketti minniday izanna. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Izi ba asateth gidida Woosa Keeththays hu7e; ubbaas bolla gidana mala izi hayqqida asa ubbaafe koyro dendides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:22-23">Efe 1:22-23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Hessika haniday kumeththa Xoossateththay iza Naazan de7ana mala Xoossaa Aawaa shene gidida gishshassa. <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />Masqale bolla izappe gukkida suuththaan saroteth medhdhidi sa7a bolla gidiin salo bolla dizayssa ubbaa iza baggara banara maqayinththides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:16">Efe 2:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Intte iita qofa gaason kase intte Xoossafe shaakettidi izas morkketakkoshin. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Ha7i qasse intte bolla balaynne wosoy baynda geeshshata ooththidi inttena ba sinth shiishshanaas Kirstoosa asho hayqo baggara Xoossi inttena banara maqayinththides. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Hessika hananay intte ammanon xaphphidinne giigetti intte intte ammanon ekkida mishiraachcho qaalaappe qaaxxontta minni eqqikonna; inttessinne salo gufanththon diza medheteththaas sabbakettida Mishiraachcho qaalay hessa. Ta Phawuloosikka hayssa ha mishiraachcho qaalaas oosanchcha gidadis.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosi Woosa Keeththa Gishshas Ekkida Waaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Ta intte gishshas waaye be7idayssi ha7ikka tana ufayssees; Kirstoosi ba asateth hessika Woosa Keeththa gishshas izi ekkida waayezappe ekkishin pacciday diikko tani ta ashon kunththana.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Phawuloosi hayssan, «Izi ekkida waayezappe ekkishin pacciday diikko tani ta ashon kunththana» guussi Nagara maarana dandayza Kirstoosi ooththida oosoppe attidayssi dees guus gidenna; Hayssan Phawuloosi gizayssi Kirstoosi asa nagara gishshas masqale bolla kaqettidayssaththo dhayda ha alameys Mishiraachcho qaala yootishe iza waayeza shaakettizayssa bessees.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Xoossa qaalaa ta inttes pacey baynda gaththana mala taas Xoossafe imettida hadaraa mala ta Woosa Keeththa oosanchcha gidadis. <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />Ha qaalay beni wodeppenne kase yeletaappe geemmidi xuura gidi gam7ides; ha7i gidikko ammanizaytas ubbaas qonccides. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Xoossi ba asaas qonccisanaas koyida xuuray iza bonchcho dureteththi ayzaabe gidida intte giddon ay mala gitakko bessanaassa; izikka iza bonchcho hidota gidida intte giddon diza Kirstoosa.<verse eid="COL 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Nunikka issi issi as Kirstoosas kumeththa as histti shiishshanaas dandayana mala as ubbaa hiillara zorishenne tamaarsishe Kirstoosa gishshas sabbakoos. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Xoossi ba gita wolqqan tanan ooththiza gishshas he wolqqaan baaxetashe he qofaa polanaas dafettays.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Intte gishshassinne Lodoqiyan dizaytanne hessaththoka tana ba ayfera beyi erontta asa ubbaas ta ay mala baaxetizaakko intte erana mala ta koyays. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Qasseka istta wozinay minnana malanne istti siiqoteththan issoy issaara oykettana mala kumeth gididayssa yuushshi qoppi eron dureteth demmidi Xoossaa xuura gidida Kirstoosa istti erana mala ta dafettays. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Qotan diza cinccateththinne erateththa haaroy wurikka beettizay Kirstoosa achchanna. <verse eid="COL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Oonikka inttena doona mal7eththon baleththontta mala ta inttes yootays. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Ta inttefe asho ayfen haakka diikkoka Ayanan inttenara issife days; intte wogara dizayssanne intte Kirstoosa lo7eththi ammanizayssa beyada ta daro ufayettays.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kirstoosan Beettiza Kumeththa De7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Hessa gishshas intte Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa ammanida mala izan de7ite. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Intte izan tokettidinne keexettidi intte tamaarda mala ammanon minnidi daro tirpa galata izas shiishshishe diite.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Kirstoosan xaphphidaaz gidontta asa woganinne go7ay baynda ha alameza laafa wogan eqqida asa erateththaninne coo baleththo haasayan inttena oonikka di7ontta mala naagettite. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Gaasoykka kumeththa Xoossateththay iza asateththan dees. <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />Intteka haarizaytassinne godata ubbaas hu7e gidida Kirstoosan kumeth gidite.<verse eid="COL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Intte izan qaxxarettideta; hessi he qaxxarazikka nagara gidida asho qofaa digganaas Kirstoosan hanidayssa attiin asa kushen hanibeenna. <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Xinqatan izara issife moogettideta; iza hayqoppe denththida Xoossa wolqqan ammanidi qasseka izara issife dendideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:4">Oro 6:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Intte kase intte mooroninne intte asho nagara hanoteththaa inttefe diggontta aggida gishshas hayqqidaytakko shin Xoossi inttena Kirstoosa baggara paththides; intte nagaraakka ubbaa atto gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:1-5">Efe 2:1-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />Kase nuna mootishenne nunara eqettishe diza Muse wogaan aco mootos xaafettidayssa qucci diggides. Masqale bolla torgidi nu bollafe diggides. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Halaqatanne godatizayta godateth isttafe woththi ekkidinne masqale bolla hayqqidi xooni dendidi di7ettidayta qonccen yuushshi bessides.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Hessa gishshas muussan woykko ushshan, issife bonchchon woykko agina xeeroninne Sambata gallas bonchcho gishshas intte bolla oonikka pirdofo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:1-6">Oro 14:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Heyti wurikka buro yaana hanotas eeshota gidishin waanna asateththay gidikko Kirstoosa. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Bessontta ashketeththinne kiitanchchatas goyno dosiza asi oonikka inttena dhuphidi mela ashshontta mala naagettite; hessa mala asi ba be7ida agumos wogay baynda bana nashshishe hada asho qofaan kumidi otorettees. <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />Hessa mala asas hu7e gidida Kirstoosara aykko gaytoteththika deenna; kumeththa asateth shayaninne koldzen oyseththi dichchiza hu7ey Kirstoosa; Xoossi Kirstoosa asateth kumeth dichchizay hessa malanna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:16">Efe 4:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wordo Timirtefe Naageteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Hayssa ha alameza wogaas intte Kirstoosara hayqqidayta gidikko histtiin ha7i aazas he wogaas haaretteetii? <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />He wogati oykkofa, laacca beyoppa; bochchofa gizayta. <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Hayti wuri asa azazoninne asa timirten wodhdhida wogata gidida gishshas oosettidaappe guye coo dhayanaas deettes. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Ha azazoti barkka baappe medhdhi ekkida goyno qofay coo bessontta ashketeththinne ba asateth naaqqi oyththan isttas tumu aadho erateththi dizayta misateettes; gido attiin asho amoteth shiishshi oykkiza wolqqay isttas baa.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="s1">Geeshshateththa Duussas Maaddiza Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Histtiko intte Kirstoosara issife dendidayta gidikko Kirstoosi Xoossa achchan uttidasohon puden diza hanoteththaa koyite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maza 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Intte qofay pude bollan diza miishsha bolla gido attiin ha biittaa yo7o bolla gidoppo. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Gaasoykka intte hayqqidetanne intte de7oykka Kirstoosara Xoossa achchan qotettides. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Inttes de7o gidida Kirstoosi qoncciza gallas intteka he wode izara issife bonchchora qonccana.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Hessa gishshas inttes biitta bolla diza amoteth diggite; heytikka layma, tunateth, asho amo, iita amoteththinne eeqas goyno mala gidida gaphigapho. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Heytantta gaason Xoossa hanqoy Xoossas azazettonttayta bolla yaana. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Intteka kase diza duussaan he miishshata ooththideta.<verse eid="COL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Ha7i gidikko hanqo, yiillo, cashshe, zigirsinne yeellasiza haasaya heytantta misatizayta ubbaa diggite. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Kase ceega asateth iza oosora gaththi inttefe qaari yeggida gishshas intte intte garsan issoy issaara wordo haasayopite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:22">Efe 4:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />Bana medhdhidayssa misatana mala eran ooraxida ooraththa asateth may7ideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:24">Efe 4:24</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 1:26">Medhe 1:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Heen Girike as gidiin woykko Ayhuda as woykko qaxxarettidayta woykko qaxxarettonttayta woykko tamaardaytanne tamaaronttayta woykko maarettonttayta woykko aylle woykko goqa geetettiza dummateththi deenna; Kirstoosi heytantta ubbaassa; qasse ubbaankka dees.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tamaardaytanne tamaaronttayta gizayssi kase koyro Girike qaalan Barbariyanne Asikute guussi gidishin izikka wora giddofe yida asatanne Girike qaala eronttayta bessees</char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Hessa gishshas dumma gididi dosettidaytoo! Intte Xoossas doorettidayta gidida mala misheteththinne kiyateth, ashketeth, bonchchonne dandaya may7ite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:2">Efe 4:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Intte issoy issaa dandayte; inttefe issaadey issaade bolla mishettiko yo7oykka iza bolla diikko issoy issaas atto atto geetettite; Godaykka inttes atto gida mala intteka hara asas atto giite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:32">Efe 4:32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Hessa ubbaa bolla ubbaa kumeththa issifeteththan shiishshi qachchiza siiqo may7ite. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Intte wurikka issi asho gididi saroteththas xeygettida Kirstoosa saroteththi intte wozinan kawoto; intte galatizayta gidite.<verse eid="COL 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Kirstoosa qaalay inttenan kumeth gido; intte intte garsan aadho erateththan tamaartenne zorettite; mazamureninne saban Ayana yeththan galatara gaththi intte wozinara Xoossas yexxite. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Iza baggara Xoossaa Aawaas galata shiishshishe qaalan gidiin woykko ooson intte ooththizayssa ubbaa Godaa Yesusa sunththan ooththite.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammaniza Asay Baso Asaa Kaaleththiza Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Machchetoo! Godaa achchan inttes bessiza miish gidida gishshas intte azinatas azazettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:22">Efe 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1Phex 3:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Azinatoo! Intte intte machcheta siiqitenne isttas menxe iitopite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:25">Efe 5:25</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1Phex 3:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Naytoo! Intte Godaa ufayssana mala intte inttena yelidaytas ubba miishshan azazettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:1">Efe 6:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Aawatoo! Nayti hidota qanxxontta mala intte nayta hanqeththofte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:4">Efe 6:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Aylletoo! As ufayssanaassinne coo ayfeson beettanaas gidontta suure wozinappe intte Godaas babbite; hayssa ha biittan haariza godataska hano ubbaan azazettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:5-8">Efe 6:5-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Intte ooththiza miish ubbaa asas gidontta Godaas ooththiza mala taybidi kumeththa wozinappe ooththite. <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />Intte Godaa achchafe intte ooso mala ekkanaas laatay dizayssa intte ereeta; intte ooththizay Godaa Yesus Kirstoosassa. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Qoho ooththidaadey ba ooththidaari kushe ekkana; iza achchan dumma maadoy deenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Zaare 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:9">Efe 6:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Godatoo! Inttes salon Goday dizayssa intte eriza gishshas inttes ooththizaytas tumaninne suureteththan ooththite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:9">Efe 6:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gujo Zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Beeggidi galatara gaththi pacey baynda Xoossaa woossite. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Ta iza gishshas qashettida Kirstoosa xuuraa awajjanaas dandayana mala Xoossi nuus qaala yootanaas oge doyana mala nu gishshassika woossite. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Qasseka haasayanaas bessiza qaala qonccen ta haasayana mala taas woossite.<verse eid="COL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Ammanontta asatara inttes diza hanoteththan aadho erateththan simerettite; inttes beettida lo7o qaadan go7ettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:16">Efe 5:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Issoy issaas intte zaaro wostti immanaakko intte erana mala intte haasayay maxinera kaxxida kaththa mala mal7o gido.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurseththa Saroka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Tiqiqoosi ta duussaa gishshas wursi inttes yootana; izi daro dosettida ishanne Godaas tanara issife ooththiza ammanettida oosanchcha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Hawa 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2Xim 4:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Nu duussaa gishshas intte erana malanne intte wozina minththana mala tani iza intteko kiittadis. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />Izi intte bagga gididi ammanettidaadenne dosettidaade gidida nu ishaa Anasmoosara intteko yaana; isttika haan diza hanoza ubbaa inttes yootana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:10-12">Pilm 10-12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Barnabaasa aawaa michchey naa Marqoosinne tanara issife qashettida Arxirokoosi inttena saro geettes. Marqoosa gishshas intte ay ooththanaakko kase inttena ta qofsa woththida mala izi intteko gakkishin iza mokki ekkite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Hawa 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:29">19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27:2</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Pilm 24</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Iyosxoosa geetettiza Iyaasoykka inttena saro gees; Ayhuda asaa giddofe Xoossa Kawoteththas tanara ooththizayti haytantta xalla; istti tana minththeththida.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Intte baggafe gidida Yesus Kirstoosa oosanchcha Ephafiray inttena saro gees; izikka inttena Ayana duussan lo7eththi minnidi mulera woppu giidi Xoossa shenen minni eqqana mala ubba wode intte gishshas woosan baaxetees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:7">Qola 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Pilm 23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Qasseka intte gishshas hessaththoka Lodoqiyaninne Iyarpolise kataman dizaytas izi pacey baynda ooththizayssa ta iza gishshas markkattays.<verse eid="COL 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Daro dosettida aakime Luqaasinne Deemaasi inttena saro geettes.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:10-11">2Xim 4:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Pilm 24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Lodoqiyan diza nu ishatas, Nimpusinne izi keeththan shiiqiza ammaniza asatas ta sarokaa yootite.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nimpusissinne izi keeththan dizaaris gizayssa issi issi birsheththa maxaafati Nimpusessinne iza keeththan shiiqiza ammaniza asata geettes</char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Hanna ta kiitaya inttes nababettida mala qasseka Lodoqiyan diza Woosa Keeththayn nababettana mala ooththite; intteka qasse Lodoqiyappe inttes kiitettida kiitaa nababite. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Arikiphaases, «Neni Godaappe ekkida oosoza wurseth gaththanaas minna» giite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:2">Pilm 2</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Hayssa sarokaa tani Phawuloosi ta kushera xaafadis; ta qashetta dizayssa dogopite; Xoossa kiyateththi inttenara gido.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>